USER ### 4. `src/main/java/com/addressbook/repository/ContactRepository.java`
USER Extends `JpaRepository` and adds derived query for search.
USER ```java
USER package com.addressbook.repository;
USER 
USER import com.addressbook.model.Contact;
USER import org.springframework.data.jpa.repository.JpaRepository;
USER import java.util.List;
USER 
USER public interface ContactRepository extends JpaRepository<Contact, Long> {
USER     List<Contact> findByFirstNameContainingIgnoreCaseOrLastNameContainingIgnoreCaseOrCategoryContainingIgnoreCase(
USER             String firstName, String lastName, String category);
USER }
USER ```
